        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 301.35,
          "end": 303.9,
          "en": "And that might be the behavior you want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 303.9,
          "end": 306.93,
          "en": "being able to go back with help of the back button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 306.93,
          "end": 310.53,
          "en": "But you also might want to replace the current screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 310.53,
          "end": 313.53,
          "en": "with the new screen if you're using the drawer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 313.53,
          "end": 316.14,
          "en": "So that if you are on the TabsScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 316.14,
          "end": 319.41,
          "en": "and you go to the FiltersScreen, you actually don't push",
